# Battle against Tapu Koko (Melemele's guardian, electric): the guardians' tom pattern and pentatonic horn call open it,
# then a fierce, quick E-minor-pentatonic square lead darts over pulse arpeggios and a galloping bass.
# Original composition for this game.
title Battle! Tapu Koko
tempo 184
meter 4/4
lowhptempo 1.06
reverb 0.22

track lead square lowhp=sawlead vol=0.62 pan=0 rev=0.18
  r1 | r1 |
  L o5 e8 e16 g16 b8 e8 o6 d8 e8 r8 o5 b8 | o6 e8 d8 o5 b8 a8 g8 a8 b4 | o5 g8 b8 o6 d8 g8 r8 d8 o5 b8 g8 | o6 a4 g8 e8 d8 e8 a4 |
